1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:29,150
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:33,210
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:40,080
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:43,390
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:48,190
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:51,860
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:57,910
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:02,710
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:10,980
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,020
=Episode 10=

12
00:01:16,070 --> 00:01:17,000
Song Ziyuan,

13
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:20,640
don't think I wouldn't dare kill you.

14
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:30,400
Leave.

15
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:33,510
And where should I go?

16
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,000
Just leave my home.

17
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:37,230
Leave Jinan City.

18
00:01:45,430 --> 00:01:46,310
Song Ziyuan,

19
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,040
do you think I'm clinging to you?

20
00:01:50,430 --> 00:01:51,840
If it weren't for Jinan City,

21
00:01:52,150 --> 00:01:53,400
if it weren't for
the Grand Shaman's seat,

22
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,840
do you think I'd want to be around you?

23
00:01:59,590 --> 00:02:00,230
Miss Chu...

24
00:02:06,590 --> 00:02:07,230
Master.

25
00:02:08,030 --> 00:02:08,800
What is it?

26
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,520
Miss Xizhao is at the door
asking to see you.

27
00:02:11,750 --> 00:02:12,470
She says

28
00:02:12,590 --> 00:02:13,960
you left something at her place.

29
00:02:22,470 --> 00:02:23,680
Chu Li, where are you going?

30
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,360
Why are you angry?

31
00:02:25,710 --> 00:02:26,360
Don't follow me.

32
00:02:26,430 --> 00:02:28,310
Chu Li, why are you angry?

33
00:02:30,590 --> 00:02:31,360
Chu Li!

34
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:35,310
Miss Chu Li.

35
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,360
Chu Li, what's wrong?

36
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:53,030
Did Diviner Song and she...

37
00:02:53,150 --> 00:02:54,360
Stop gossiping.

38
00:02:54,910 --> 00:02:55,750
Alright.

39
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,080
This way, miss.

40
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:13,400
Greetings, Diviner Song.

41
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,310
What is it?

42
00:03:16,470 --> 00:03:18,520
After drinking last night, Diviner Song,

43
00:03:19,030 --> 00:03:20,630
you left your handkerchief
at our tavern.

44
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,080
I've come today

45
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:23,560
especially to return it.

46
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,000
Throw it away.

47
00:03:36,150 --> 00:03:37,240
Anything else?

48
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,000
No...

49
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,520
Nothing.

50
00:03:41,910 --> 00:03:42,710
See her out.

51
00:03:44,430 --> 00:03:45,240
This way, miss.

52
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:52,590
Shiqi.

53
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:57,590
Master.

54
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,430
Go follow Chu Li.

55
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:02,150
Keep me informed of her every move.

56
00:04:03,470 --> 00:04:04,800
If she's in danger,

57
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:06,960
you must save her at once.

58
00:04:07,310 --> 00:04:09,030
Don't let anyone give her a hard time.

59
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:12,150
Understood.

60
00:04:16,140 --> 00:04:18,860
(Sanxiu Tavern)

61
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,360
Do you have money?

62
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:22,950
Me?

63
00:04:23,270 --> 00:04:24,560
How would I have money?

64
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:25,950
You know I came

65
00:04:26,070 --> 00:04:27,139
to Jinan City all alone.

66
00:04:27,181 --> 00:04:28,720
If you have no money, why follow me?

67
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,480
Well, I...

68
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:32,040
I was worried about you.

69
00:04:32,190 --> 00:04:33,160
You're all by yourself.

70
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:34,920
It's all Diviner Song's fault

71
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,830
for making you angry.

72
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,190
Then go to him.

73
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,360
At least he won't let you
sleep out in the open.

74
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,510
Chu Li,

75
00:04:41,830 --> 00:04:42,870
you know well that

76
00:04:43,750 --> 00:04:44,600
if you leave,

77
00:04:44,950 --> 00:04:46,480
he might not let me stay either.

78
00:04:47,950 --> 00:04:49,390
At least you're self-aware.

79
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,160
(I can't go back to the Shaman Clan.)

80
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:56,270
(I can't just end up
on the streets, can I?)

81
00:05:02,390 --> 00:05:03,040
Chu Li,

82
00:05:03,430 --> 00:05:04,630
can we stop walking now?

83
00:05:06,270 --> 00:05:07,190
I'm exhausted.

84
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:11,480
Xiuxiu.

85
00:05:14,870 --> 00:05:16,190
A snake! A snake!

86
00:05:16,270 --> 00:05:16,870
A snake...

87
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:17,830
Snake...

88
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,510
Xiuxiu, go get me some money.

89
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,190
Go on, quick. You can do it.

90
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:32,270
Chu Li,

91
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,630
you're amazing.

92
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:36,480
You can actually command a snake
to steal money for you.

93
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,070
Steal?

94
00:05:38,510 --> 00:05:39,560
This is borrowing.

95
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:41,360
When I have money, I'll pay it back.

96
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:53,160
Miss Xizhao, you have a guest.

97
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,430
Tell him I'm unwell today

98
00:05:55,750 --> 00:05:56,720
and can't see anyone.

99
00:05:57,270 --> 00:05:58,270
But...

100
00:05:59,830 --> 00:06:00,480
Get lost!

101
00:06:02,430 --> 00:06:03,240
Yes.

102
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,720
Just wait a little longer, okay?

103
00:06:10,310 --> 00:06:11,480
Just a bit longer.

104
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,800
I beg you.

105
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,430
Good heavens!

106
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,169
A snake!

107
00:06:33,211 --> 00:06:33,920
What's wrong?

108
00:06:36,430 --> 00:06:37,800
Xiuxiu, well done.

109
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:42,630
Chu Li,

110
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,190
we have money now!

111
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:48,070
That little snake of yours is so useful.

112
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:49,920
What do you mean, "we"?

113
00:06:50,070 --> 00:06:51,160
This is mine.

114
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:53,600
Take the bag.

115
00:06:55,750 --> 00:06:56,430
Chu Li.

116
00:07:07,070 --> 00:07:07,800
Chu Li,

117
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:09,800
booking two rooms

118
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,190
would be such a waste of money.

119
00:07:12,430 --> 00:07:13,190
What,

120
00:07:13,430 --> 00:07:14,870
you want to share a room with me?

121
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,160
I wouldn't say no.

122
00:07:21,630 --> 00:07:22,430
Two rooms.

123
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,240
No problem.

124
00:07:44,140 --> 00:07:47,380
♪Moonlight spills over
gray tiles and walls♪

125
00:07:48,460 --> 00:07:51,350
♪Wind chimes sway, evoking old times♪

126
00:07:52,630 --> 00:07:53,409
- Take it.
- You...

127
00:07:53,451 --> 00:07:54,310
Just take it.

128
00:07:56,190 --> 00:07:56,950
No need.

129
00:07:57,390 --> 00:07:58,160
Still, thank you.

130
00:08:00,010 --> 00:08:02,930
♪Red threads wind through a few lines
of the book of fate♪

131
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:07,300
♪Yet one passionate look undoes it all♪

132
00:08:07,870 --> 00:08:10,230
♪No mountain or sea can bar the way♪

133
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,000
(Li,)

134
00:08:13,270 --> 00:08:14,390
(I'm so tired.)

135
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:17,920
Why dwell on any of this?

136
00:08:18,630 --> 00:08:19,920
He drove you out.

137
00:08:27,270 --> 00:08:28,600
The lamp oil is almost gone.

138
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:34,840
Whether he lives or dies
is none of my concern.

139
00:08:38,220 --> 00:08:41,679
(26 Days Before the City Falls)

140
00:08:41,721 --> 00:08:42,390
Master,

141
00:08:42,750 --> 00:08:44,120
Miss Chu Li and Fusheng

142
00:08:44,390 --> 00:08:45,510
have settled at the tavern.

143
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:48,550
I see.

144
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:51,510
Have you checked
Luo Fusheng's background?

145
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,000
Yan City sent word.

146
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,030
They confirmed he's real,

147
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:57,720
but he left Yan City a year ago.

148
00:09:02,390 --> 00:09:03,080
Master,

149
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:05,390
if you're worried about Miss Chu Li,

150
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:07,440
why not keep her at the residence?

151
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,550
Her staying by my side

152
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,870
is what's truly dangerous.

153
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,030
(Li,)

154
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:43,000
(if leaving can save you,)

155
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,790
(then let me be the one you hate.)

156
00:09:50,540 --> 00:09:51,820
(Chu State)

157
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:18,080
(I have more important things to do.)

158
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,120
(I have to protect Jinan City.)

159
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:23,440
(How could I leave just because of
a few words from Song Ziyuan?)

160
00:10:30,790 --> 00:10:32,390
What... What happened here?

161
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:40,480
What's wrong?

162
00:10:40,910 --> 00:10:42,030
I heard a noise,

163
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,150
so I came out to look.

164
00:10:45,030 --> 00:10:45,670
Excuse me.

165
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:46,630
Go check on her.

166
00:10:50,510 --> 00:10:51,600
What's going on?

167
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:52,960
I don't know.

168
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:54,720
I saw that she collapsed
the moment she came in.

169
00:10:55,870 --> 00:10:57,000
Could there be a monster?

170
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,080
Monster?

171
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:58,840
A demon?

172
00:10:58,891 --> 00:10:59,630
Chu Li.

173
00:11:00,150 --> 00:11:01,270
No, of course not.

174
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:03,270
There's no demon in our tavern.

175
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:05,910
Who's this?

176
00:11:06,150 --> 00:11:07,270
Another guest here?

177
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:10,960
Judging by her clothes,

178
00:11:11,270 --> 00:11:12,240
she should be...

179
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,670
She's Miss Huayue from Huancai Pavilion!

180
00:11:15,750 --> 00:11:16,529
Miss Huayue?

181
00:11:16,571 --> 00:11:18,000
Huancai Pavilion again.

182
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:19,870
I heard she was

183
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,480
thrown out for growing old
and losing her looks.

184
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,720
What on earth happened?

185
00:11:23,030 --> 00:11:23,670
She...

186
00:11:24,150 --> 00:11:26,150
Maybe she ran into a demon.

187
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:27,080
A demon?

188
00:11:27,630 --> 00:11:28,440
A demon!

189
00:11:28,670 --> 00:11:29,510
Go back, all of you.

190
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,670
I'll go report to the authorities.

191
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:40,360
Chu Li, don't touch her.

192
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:42,600
They're all looking for a demon.

193
00:11:43,150 --> 00:11:44,150
Back away.

194
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,390
What's wrong, Chu Li?

195
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:50,150
(What a familiar scent.)

196
00:12:12,390 --> 00:12:13,320
(It smells)

197
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:15,440
(like that bamboo slip.)

198
00:12:17,510 --> 00:12:18,360
Chu Li,

199
00:12:18,750 --> 00:12:19,840
there isn't really

200
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,840
a demon in this tavern, is there?

201
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:24,080
You scared?

202
00:12:25,550 --> 00:12:27,000
Aren't I here?

203
00:12:27,270 --> 00:12:28,150
Go back to sleep.

204
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:31,790
I'm too scared.

205
00:12:35,150 --> 00:12:36,720
Don't tell me you want to sleep with me.

206
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,240
Get out! Out!

207
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:40,390
I'll sleep on the floor.

208
00:12:40,630 --> 00:12:41,390
Off you go.

209
00:13:01,670 --> 00:13:02,360
Chu Li,

210
00:13:02,550 --> 00:13:03,600
do you think there really

211
00:13:03,750 --> 00:13:04,960
might be a demon in there?

212
00:13:05,670 --> 00:13:06,720
It should be right here.

213
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,240
Then, Chu Li,

214
00:13:09,750 --> 00:13:11,030
let's not go in.

215
00:13:11,750 --> 00:13:12,480
Then don't come.

216
00:13:12,630 --> 00:13:13,360
I'll go alone.

217
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:14,440
I...

218
00:13:17,870 --> 00:13:19,030
(I wonder what Miss Xizhao)

219
00:13:19,150 --> 00:13:20,390
(actually looks like.)

220
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:21,510
(Exactly.)

221
00:13:25,750 --> 00:13:27,630
Where is Miss Xizhao?

222
00:13:28,910 --> 00:13:31,120
Miss Xizhao has been unwell
for the past few days.

223
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,550
and cannot come out to receive guests.

224
00:13:35,390 --> 00:13:37,000
(She went to see Song Ziyuan yesterday.)

225
00:13:37,150 --> 00:13:38,790
(Why is she unwell today?)

226
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:41,120
I've admired Miss Xizhao
for a long time.

227
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:42,840
May I go see her?

228
00:13:44,550 --> 00:13:45,510
Well...

229
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,750
We came here for Miss Xizhao too.

230
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,910
Why can't she come out to meet us?

231
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:50,840
Exactly.

232
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,649
Right, we came specially

233
00:13:52,691 --> 00:13:54,910
for Miss Xizhao's "Farewell Song."

234
00:13:55,150 --> 00:13:56,440
Isn't this a wasted trip?

235
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:59,390
Honored guests, please wait a moment.

236
00:13:59,630 --> 00:14:01,080
I'll go ask Miss Xizhao again.

237
00:14:03,670 --> 00:14:04,390
Chu Li,

238
00:14:05,080 --> 00:14:06,150
you suspect

239
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,600
that Miss Xizhao is a demon?

240
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,150
Let's wait and see.

241
00:14:15,670 --> 00:14:16,750
How much longer?

242
00:14:17,390 --> 00:14:18,630
We've been waiting so long.

243
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,960
If I don't see Miss Xizhao today,

244
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:22,440
I won't drink this wine.

245
00:14:23,550 --> 00:14:26,080
Hurry up! Is she coming or not?

246
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:28,670
She's here!

247
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:30,030
She's here!

248
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:31,670
Chu Li, she's here.

249
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:52,030
She's beautiful, as expected.

250
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:04,270
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

251
00:15:05,890 --> 00:15:11,350
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

252
00:15:12,970 --> 00:15:16,200
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

253
00:15:16,370 --> 00:15:19,680
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

254
00:15:19,810 --> 00:15:25,590
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

255
00:15:27,050 --> 00:15:32,270
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

256
00:15:34,130 --> 00:15:40,320
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

257
00:15:40,570 --> 00:15:44,080
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

258
00:15:44,130 --> 00:15:47,419
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

259
00:15:47,461 --> 00:15:54,400
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

260
00:15:54,650 --> 00:15:57,960
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

261
00:15:58,290 --> 00:16:02,200
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

262
00:16:02,250 --> 00:16:08,560
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

263
00:16:37,630 --> 00:16:44,419
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

264
00:16:44,461 --> 00:16:50,640
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
